                                """,
                            });
                            message_Mail({
                                english="Oof... I sure miss my home and folks. Yup yup!",
                            });
                            message_Mail({
                                english="""
                                    But![K] I can't be what I want to be if I admit
                                    defeat now! No sirree, by golly!
                                """,
                            });
                            message_Mail({
                                english="""
                                    Yup yup! I have my big dream![K] I'm surely going
