                                message_Mail({
                                    english="""
                                        I surely can't do that. It's just not done.[K]
                                        Who could live that down?
                                    """,
                                });
                                message_Mail({
                                    english="""
                                        And sneaking into the Guildmaster's room was
                                        too scary. So I gave that a pass and kept
                                        nosing around elsewhere. Yup yup.
                                    """,
                                });
                                message_Mail({
                                    english="""
                                        Now, that [CS:N]Chatot[CR]! By golly, that one gave me
                                        quite the start!
                                    """,
                                });
                                message_Mail({
                                    english="""
                                        So, diary, where'd you reckon that [CS:N]Chatot[CR]
                                        sleeps at night?
                                    """,
                                });
                                message_Mail({
                                    english="""
                                        Well, surprise, surprise![K] He sleeps on the top
