                                    """,
                                });
                                message_Mail({
                                    english="""
                                        When I crept nearby, he thought I was trying
                                        to run away, by golly...
                                    """,
                                });
                                message_Mail({
                                    english="""
                                        So he wildly attacked me![K] I'm still sore all
                                        over from that, by gosh!
                                    """,
                                });
                                message_Mail({
                                    english="""
                                        P.S. [CS:P]Crystal Cave[CR] sure lived up to its name,
                                        being full of crystals and all.
                                    """,
                                });
                                message_Mail({
                                    english="It surely was a pretty place! Yup yup.",
