                                message_Mail({
                                    english="""
                                        [CN][CS:N]Bidoof[CR]'s Yup Yup Journal
                                        [CN]Entry 5: Moves Are Awesome!
                                        [CN]OO Month XX Day, Sunny
                                    """,
                                });
                                message_Mail({
                                    english="""
                                        Well, seems there's another thing I was
                                        clueless about!
                                    """,
                                });
                                message_Mail({
                                    english="""
                                        When you use moves instead of regular attacks
                                        to defeat an enemy, you get more Exp. Points.
                                        Did everyone know that but me?
                                    """,
                                });
                                message_Mail({
                                    english="I didn't know that! But there's more!",
                                });
                                message_Mail({
                                    english="You need to hit the foe only once with a move.",
                                });
                                message_Mail({
                                    english="""
                                        Other than that one move, you can strike it
                                        with regular attacks. And you still get the
                                        boosted Exp. Points. How about that, by golly?
                                    """,
                                });
                                message_Mail({
                                    english="""
                                        Moves also have higher critical-hit rates than
                                        the regular attack. So you're cheating yourself
                                        if you're not using moves!
                                    """,
                                });
                                message_Mail({
                                    english="""
                                        I'll be using more moves! Starting tomorrow!
                                        Yup yup!
                                    """,
                                });
                                message_Mail({
                                    english="""
                                        P.S. So... I did exactly what I promised I
                                        would! I used lots of moves while exploring!
                                    """,
                                });
                                message_Mail({
                                    english="""
                                        But I used my moves so often that I ran out
                                        of PP for my moves almost right away...
                                    """,
                                });
                                message_Mail({
                                    english="""
                                        Oof...[K] Exploring is never as easy as it looks,
